{"id":"n65201-3-8","stage":3,"title":"수상 · 首相","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65201-3-8-1","ko":"그분은 한 나라의 수상까지 지내셨는데도 참 겸손하세요.","zh":"他虽然曾担任一个国家的总理，却依然十分谦逊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그분은","meaning":"那位","explanation":"그분：那位；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그분","audio":"/audio/9d7be380673c1fb2eb99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60635","senseId":"1","lemma":"그분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그분은","audio":"/audio/46d1da0d66b82c1e5677.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"나라의","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라의","audio":"/audio/095420e8007af958c2d9.mp3"}},{"text":"수상까지","meaning":"首相","explanation":"수상：首相；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"수상","audio":"/audio/936c3936af29d9ad77bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65201","senseId":"3","lemma":"수상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수상까지","audio":"/audio/be4f9e80e6535dac6bf1.mp3"}},{"text":"지내셨는데도","meaning":"当","explanation":"지내다：当；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"3","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내셨는데도","audio":"/audio/0dc4f5d05472acc0091e.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"겸손하세요.","meaning":"谦虚，谦逊","explanation":"겸손하다：谦虚，谦逊；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"겸손하다","audio":"/audio/1e6634f1f60451aa42f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30425","senseId":"1","lemma":"겸손하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겸손하세요","audio":"/audio/4dae082a1103fd0737f5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9d7be380673c1fb2","term":"그분","zh":"那位","audio":"/audio/9d7be380673c1fb2eb99.mp3","entryId":"60635","definition":"(高尊)那个人。","pronunciation":["그분"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"936c3936af29d9ad","term":"수상","zh":"首相","audio":"/audio/936c3936af29d9ad77bd.mp3","entryId":"65201","definition":"君主立宪制国家内阁的首脑。","pronunciation":["수상"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"当","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"担任某种职位或职务而工作。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"1e6634f1f60451aa","term":"겸손하다","zh":"谦虚，谦逊","audio":"/audio/1e6634f1f60451aa42f1.mp3","entryId":"30425","definition":"具有尊重他人、放低自己的心理或态度。","pronunciation":["겸손하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f439f56396b15708eb4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65201-3-8-2","ko":"그래서 국민들의 사랑을 한 몸에 받으셨지요.","zh":"正因如此，他才深受全国人民的爱戴吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1",