민","zh":"国民","audio":"/audio/f8d6d99284c0c268e1f8.mp3","entryId":"60100","definition":"构成一个国家的人；或指持有该国国籍的人。","pronunciation":["궁민"]},{"id":"ff2763f11c21f167","term":"사랑","zh":"疼爱，关爱","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3","entryId":"66649","definition":"爱护珍惜并真诚相待的心。","pronunciation":["사랑"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"之身，之躯","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指那样的身份或那样的人。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6f925b7e985c5c3f4f1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65201","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["正因如此，他才深受全国人民的爱戴吧。","他虽然曾担任一个国家的总理，却依然十分谦逊。","请让我从这里出去吧！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他虽然曾担任一个国家的总理，却依然十分谦逊。","请让我从这里出去吧！","正因如此，他才深受全国人民的爱戴吧。"],"answer":2}]}
